 M←{                                      ⍝ Minimisation
     B←Bounded(3↑(2↓⍵),(⌈/⍬)(⌊/⍬)⎕CT)     ⍝ Coleman-Li bounds
     3=≢e←⍺⍺ Eval⊃⍵:⍺ ⍺⍺ B Newton ⍵⍵ 2↑⍵  ⍝ Newton
     0=≢⍴⊃e:⍺ ⍺⍺ BFGS B Newton ⍵⍵ 2↑⍵     ⍝ Broyden–Fletcher–Goldfarb–Shanno
     ⍺ ⍺⍺ LM B Newton ⍵⍵ 2↑⍵              ⍝ Levenberg-Marquardt
 }
